Artist exclusives
One thing Tidal does have going for it are artist exclusives and full-length videos. True tastemakers may find the selection wanting, but casual listeners will be pleased to find gems like exclusive footage from Alicia Keys's recent concert at Madison Square Garden and handcrafted playlists from the likes of Coldplay and Beyoncé (both{r} of{g} whom{r} were{g} at{r} the{r} T{g}idal{g} launch{g}).{r}
